<title>ROMANIA: BUCHAREST BOURSE CLOSED THIS WEEK.</title>
<headline>BUCHAREST BOURSE CLOSED THIS WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bucharest stock exchange has no trading session this week as it installs a new software to improve trading and settlement.</p>
<p>Bourse officials said they expected the bourse to go into trading again on October 1.</p>
</text>
